In this repository you will fine a code file for connecting basic sensors to Arduino and use them through serial connection to send input data to MAX/MSP

Items in this repository
1) Tinkercad project: https://www.tinkercad.com/things/4dJ6tpV1vfa-nime-toolkit?sharecode=BXT_UtDqIoPu8uNyg6y5OoPZoefTKJLRXwoaxkTs6gQ
2) Arduino code file - with accelerometer
3) images of connections
4) MAX/MSP patch for receiving serial information
5) list of components used in the example
